# Keep the build context small and keep secrets out of the image.

# Secrets. These are gitignored too, but the build context is taken from the
# working directory, so an uncommitted .env would otherwise be copied in.
.env
*.env
!.env.example
**/.env
**/*.env.local

# Version control and tooling
.git
.gitignore
.github
.vscode
.idea

# Python environments and caches
**/.venv
**/venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info
.pytest_cache
.mypy_cache
.ruff_cache

# Node. The frontend stage installs its own dependencies from the lockfile.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.vite
npm-debug.log*

# Scraped and generated data, plus notebooks and model artefacts. None of it
# is needed to run the service, and some of it is large.
data
ml/data
ml/notebooks
**/*.pt
**/*.h5
**/*.pkl
**/*.joblib
**/*.safetensors
**/*.csv
!ml/skills/*.json

# Documentation and OS noise
docs
*.md
!README.md
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
